        "subject": "LU-20427 tests: Incorrect debug mask in sanity-lnet",
        "message": "LU-20427 tests: Incorrect debug mask in sanity-lnet\n\nPatch https://review.whamcloud.com/66451 dropped \"neterror net\nnettrace malloc\" arguments from set_default_debug and moved them to\nSUBSYSTEM environment variable at the top of sanity-lnet.sh, but\nSUBSYSTEM is the variable used to set subsystem_debug mask, not the\ndebug mask. The correct variable is PTLDEBUG.\n\nFixes: b9701f58d0 (\"LU-20329 tests: debug fixing and improvments\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Ib85cfa0fa0b79c6c24189f9797cdd102b1b17924\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66868\nReviewed-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
